:1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"blind_id\":\"HOX006\",\"coverage\":[{\"point\":1,\"credit\":1,\"reason\":\"States the ICAV is 'a single body corporate with its own legal personality' and that sub-funds 'are compartments of that entity, not separate legal persons'.\"},{\"point\":2,\"credit\":1,\"reason\":\"Says sub-funds 'cannot sue, be sued, or contract in their own names. The ICAV acts on their behalf', and describes segregation as statutory, within the ICAV framework, rather than separate personality.\"}],\"central_error\":null,\"local_error\":null,\"grade\":\"correct\",\"rationale\":\"Both required minimums are covered. The answer explicitly rejects separate sub-fund personality, so there is no central error. The caveat about foreign recognition of segregation is a reasonable side point and is not contradicted by the evidence. The truncated final sentence is an omission, not a falsehood.\"}","ttft_ms":2129,"type":"result","duration_ms":4340,"uuid":"95ed42cb-1b7d-4312-a76d-aae16c2d6f59","ttft_stream_ms":541,"time_to_request_ms":91,"first_content_frame_ms":541,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
